# One API key per line. The stored value must be the SHA-256 hash of the key.
# Generate a hash with:
#   printf '%s' 'your-api-key' | sha256sum
#
# An optional label may precede the hash for reference (it is ignored by
# auth):  label = <sha256>
# A bare hash on its own line is also accepted (no label).
#
# Lines beginning with # or ; and blank lines are ignored.
# Keep apikeys.conf private — it should never leave the ComfyUI host.

# Example:
# my-comfyui-key = 9f86d081884c7d659a2feaa0c55ad015a3bf4f1b2b0b822cd15d6c15b0f0010a
